=2 Walkthrough
>**__You must first complete the {p:First Step Forward} {p:Records of Eminence} objective**__
* Speak to {n:Jourdenaux} while in possession of a {i:Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|17386} to flag this quest.
* This will unlock a new {p:Records of Eminence} category "Fishing > Fishing (Tenacity)"
* You must now do the following:
** Catch 60 different types of fish
*** You can use any rod to accomplish this.
*** Catching the fish can be done in tandem to completing the Fishing (Tenacity) objectives, or the fish can have been caught previously.
*** Use {n:Katsunaga} to tell you how many types of fish you have caught so far.
** Complete all Fishing (Tenacity) objectives
*** You must complete all of the objectives under this category using only your {i:Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|17386}.
*** Lures to catch multiple fish at once is effective for certain tasks that require many fish.
* After completing all of the objectives, trade your {i:Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|17386} to {n:Jourdenaux} to complete the quest and for your reward.

